# Historical Experiment Archive

This archive preserves the progressive operational reconstruction chain of the framework spanning experimental generations:

- v1 → v35

The currently exposed repository layer contains the finalized v35 operational synthesis and retention validation packages.

Earlier operational generations are progressively reconstructed and archived in order to preserve:

- theorem evolution continuity,
- experimental traceability,
- operational reproducibility,
- validation transparency,
- and historical framework development pathways.

The v35 packages currently represent the consolidated operational state of the framework after multiple reconstruction and validation cycles.
